Lightweight homes, warps, TPA, back, RTP, and player toggles for [B]Spigot[/B].

Players get a shared teleport countdown, a simple GUI, and translatable messages. Operators get warps, home limits, reload, and an optional GitHub update notice.

[IMG]https://file.garden/apESCVYBqnKcJ-mg/AU/INSTALLATION.png[/IMG]

Install [B]AuraUtils-<version>-spigot.jar[/B] in [ICODE]plugins/[/ICODE], then restart.

[TABLE]
[TR][TH]Server[/TH][TH]Install[/TH][/TR]
[TR][TD]Spigot[/TD][TD][ICODE]AuraUtils-<version>-spigot.jar[/ICODE][/TD][/TR]
[/TABLE]

[LIST]
[*]Edit [ICODE]plugins/AuraUtils/config.yml[/ICODE] if you want.
[*]On first start the plugin copies [ICODE]lang/en.yml[/ICODE]. Translate it or add another locale and set [ICODE]language:[/ICODE].
[*]Run [ICODE]/aura reload[/ICODE] ([ICODE]aura.admin[/ICODE]) after config or language edits.
[/LIST]

[IMG]https://file.garden/apESCVYBqnKcJ-mg/AU/FEATURES.png[/IMG]
[LIST]
[*]Homes with optional GUI, name rules, overwrite confirm, and optional limits
[*]Server warps with optional GUI and overwrite confirm
[*]Timed TPA plus a trusted list that auto-accepts requests
[*][ICODE]/back[/ICODE], safe [ICODE]/rtp[/ICODE], god, fly, nofall, nohunger
[*][ICODE]/menu[/ICODE] utility GUI
[*]Shared countdown: chat, action bar, title, cancel on move/damage, rising-pitch sounds
[*][ICODE]aura.teleport.bypass[/ICODE] for instant teleports
[*]All player-facing text in [ICODE]lang/en.yml[/ICODE]
[/LIST]

Trusted TPA: [ICODE]/tpatrust <player>[/ICODE] adds them to your list. They can [ICODE]/tpa[/ICODE] you without [ICODE]/tpaccept[/ICODE]. Manage with [ICODE]/tpatrust list[/ICODE] and [ICODE]/tpauntrust <player>[/ICODE]. Cancel a countdown or an outgoing TPA with [ICODE]/tpacancel[/ICODE] ([ICODE]/tpcancel[/ICODE], [ICODE]/auracancel[/ICODE]).

[B]Commands[/B]
[TABLE]
[TR][TH]Command[/TH][TH]Permission[/TH][TH]Description[/TH][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]/home [name|list][/ICODE][/TD][TD][ICODE]aura.home[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Teleport to a home or open the home GUI[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]/sethome <name>[/ICODE][/TD][TD][ICODE]aura.home.set[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Create or update a home[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]/delhome <name>[/ICODE][/TD][TD][ICODE]aura.home.delete[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Delete a home[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]/warp [name|list][/ICODE][/TD][TD][ICODE]aura.warp[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Teleport to a warp or open the warp GUI[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]/setwarp <name>[/ICODE][/TD][TD][ICODE]aura.warp.set[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Create or update a warp[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]/delwarp <name>[/ICODE][/TD][TD][ICODE]aura.warp.delete[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Delete a warp[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]/tpa <player>|list[/ICODE][/TD][TD][ICODE]aura.tpa[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Send a TPA request or open the TPA GUI[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]/tpaccept[/ICODE] / [ICODE]/tpadeny[/ICODE][/TD][TD][ICODE]aura.tpa[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Accept or deny a pending TPA[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]/tpacancel[/ICODE][/TD][TD][ICODE]aura.use[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Cancel a countdown or outgoing TPA[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]/tpatrust[/ICODE] / [ICODE]/tpauntrust[/ICODE][/TD][TD][ICODE]aura.tpa.trust[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Manage your trusted TPA list[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]/back[/ICODE][/TD][TD][ICODE]aura.back[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Return to the last teleport location[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]/rtp[/ICODE][/TD][TD][ICODE]aura.rtp[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Random safe teleport[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]/god [player][/ICODE][/TD][TD][ICODE]aura.god[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Toggle invincibility[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]/fly [player][/ICODE][/TD][TD][ICODE]aura.fly[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Toggle flight[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]/nofall [player][/ICODE][/TD][TD][ICODE]aura.nofall[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Toggle fall damage[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]/nohunger [player][/ICODE][/TD][TD][ICODE]aura.nohunger[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Toggle hunger depletion[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]/menu[/ICODE][/TD][TD][ICODE]aura.menu[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Open the utility GUI[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]/aura [reload][/ICODE][/TD][TD][ICODE]aura.use[/ICODE] / [ICODE]aura.admin[/ICODE][/TD][TD]Command list; reload config and language[/TD][/TR]
[/TABLE]

[IMG]https://file.garden/apESCVYBqnKcJ-mg/AU/REQUIREMENTS.png[/IMG]
[LIST]
[*]Java [B]21+[/B] (Minecraft [B]26.1+[/B] servers need Java 25)
[*]Minecraft [B]1.21.x[/B] and [B]26.1 / 26.2[/B]
[*]Spigot
[/LIST]

[IMG]https://files.catbox.moe/pwsw8n.png[/IMG]
[CODE]
tpa:
  timeout: 60
  trusted-max: 50
  trusted-instant: false

homes:
  default-limit: 3
  limits:
    - permission: aura.homes.vip
      max: 5
    - permission: aura.homes.unlimited
      max: 0

rtp:
  radius: 2000
  minDistance: 250
  attempts: 30
  generate-unloaded: true
  max-sync-generations: 3

teleport:
  countdown: 5
  countdown-display: both
  chat-at: [3, 2, 1]
  title: true
  cancel-on-move: true
  sound: true
  sound-rising-pitch: true

language: en
prefix: "&8[&bAura&8] &r"

update-checker:
  enabled: true
[/CODE]

Home and warp names are 1–32 letters, numbers, [ICODE]_[/ICODE], or [ICODE]-[/ICODE]. Overwriting an existing name asks for clickable CONFIRM / CANCEL (30 seconds).

[ICODE]chat-at: [3, 2, 1][/ICODE] always announces the start (for example 5), then only those remaining seconds. Action bar and title still update every second.

When [ICODE]update-checker.enabled[/ICODE] is true, operators with [ICODE]aura.admin[/ICODE] get a clickable chat link if a newer GitHub release exists.

[IMG]https://files.catbox.moe/rc5ojm.png[/IMG]
[TABLE]
[TR][TH]Permission[/TH][TH]Default[/TH][TH]Description[/TH][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]aura.use[/ICODE][/TD][TD]true[/TD][TD]Basic access / [ICODE]/tpacancel[/ICODE][/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]aura.menu[/ICODE][/TD][TD]true[/TD][TD]Open the utility menu[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]aura.back[/ICODE][/TD][TD]true[/TD][TD]Use [ICODE]/back[/ICODE][/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]aura.warp[/ICODE][/TD][TD]true[/TD][TD]Use warp commands[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]aura.warp.set[/ICODE][/TD][TD]op[/TD][TD]Create/update warps[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]aura.warp.delete[/ICODE][/TD][TD]op[/TD][TD]Delete warps[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]aura.home[/ICODE][/TD][TD]true[/TD][TD]Use home commands[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]aura.home.set[/ICODE][/TD][TD]true[/TD][TD]Set homes[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]aura.home.delete[/ICODE][/TD][TD]true[/TD][TD]Delete homes[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]aura.tpa[/ICODE][/TD][TD]true[/TD][TD]Use tpa / tpaccept / tpadeny[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]aura.tpa.trust[/ICODE][/TD][TD]true[/TD][TD]Manage trusted TPA list[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]aura.god[/ICODE] / [ICODE]aura.god.others[/ICODE][/TD][TD]op[/TD][TD]God mode for self / others[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]aura.fly[/ICODE] / [ICODE]aura.fly.others[/ICODE][/TD][TD]op[/TD][TD]Fly for self / others[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]aura.nofall[/ICODE] / [ICODE]aura.nofall.others[/ICODE][/TD][TD]op[/TD][TD]Fall damage for self / others[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]aura.nohunger[/ICODE] / [ICODE]aura.nohunger.others[/ICODE][/TD][TD]op[/TD][TD]Hunger for self / others[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]aura.rtp[/ICODE][/TD][TD]true[/TD][TD]Random safe teleport[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]aura.teleport.bypass[/ICODE][/TD][TD]op[/TD][TD]Skip teleport countdown[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD][ICODE]aura.admin[/ICODE][/TD][TD]op[/TD][TD]All permissions, including [ICODE]/aura reload[/ICODE][/TD][/TR]
[/TABLE]

[IMG]https://file.garden/apESCVYBqnKcJ-mg/AU/UPGRADE%20NOTE.png[/IMG]
Replace the jar with [ICODE]AuraUtils-<version>-spigot.jar[/ICODE]. After first start, translate [ICODE]plugins/AuraUtils/lang/en.yml[/ICODE] or add another [ICODE]lang/<code>.yml[/ICODE]. Add [ICODE]language:[/ICODE], [ICODE]homes.default-limit[/ICODE], and [ICODE]update-checker.enabled[/ICODE] to an existing [ICODE]config.yml[/ICODE] if those keys are missing.

[B][SIZE=5]Changelog[/SIZE][/B]

[B]1.3.0[/B]
[B]Added[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Translatable messages in [ICODE]lang/en.yml[/ICODE]; set [ICODE]language:[/ICODE] and add [ICODE]lang/<code>.yml[/ICODE] for extra locales
[*][ICODE]/aura reload[/ICODE] reloads config and language ([ICODE]aura.admin[/ICODE])
[*]Home limits: [ICODE]homes.default-limit[/ICODE] and permission-based [ICODE]homes.limits[/ICODE] (set a positive default before VIP caps)
[*]Safer [ICODE]/sethome[/ICODE] / [ICODE]/setwarp[/ICODE]: 1–32 letter/number/[ICODE]_[/ICODE]/[ICODE]-[/ICODE] names and clickable overwrite confirm
[*]Optional GitHub update checker ([ICODE]update-checker.enabled[/ICODE]); [ICODE]aura.admin[/ICODE] gets a clickable releases link
[/LIST]
[B]Fixed[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Concurrent TPA request lifecycle (cancel / player quit)
[*]Folia-safe pending teleport and [ICODE]/back[/ICODE] state
[*]Paper async RTP chunk-load detection
[*]Teleport success waits for the async result (trusted instant TPA and countdown-0 home/warp/back included)
[*][ICODE]/aura[/ICODE] status shows ON/OFF instead of raw keys, and color no longer leaks onto Fly / NoHunger labels
[/LIST]
[B]Changed[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Package [ICODE]com.lozaine.aurautils[/ICODE] (main class [ICODE]com.lozaine.aurautils.AuraUtils[/ICODE])
[*]Marketplace filename: [ICODE]AuraUtils-<version>-spigot.jar[/ICODE] (same bytecode as [ICODE]AuraUtils-<version>-paper-folia.jar[/ICODE])
[/LIST]

[B]1.2.2 — RTP watchdog / Folia TPA[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Spigot [ICODE]/rtp[/ICODE] no longer generates unloaded chunks on the tick thread
[*]Folia [ICODE]/tpaccept[/ICODE] hops to the requester’s entity thread
[*]Teleport success only after the teleport future completes
[/LIST]

[B]1.2.0 — Trusted / instant TPA[/B]
[LIST]
[*][ICODE]/tpatrust[/ICODE], [ICODE]/tpauntrust[/ICODE] — personal trusted list; trusted players auto-accept TPA
[*]Config: [ICODE]tpa.trusted-max[/ICODE], [ICODE]tpa.trusted-instant[/ICODE]
[*]Permission [ICODE]aura.tpa.trust[/ICODE] (default: true)
[/LIST]

[B]1.1.1 — Folia fixes[/B]
[LIST]
[*]RTP height/surface checks on the target location’s region
[*][ICODE]/back[/ICODE] records location before teleport (Folia often skips PlayerTeleportEvent)
[/LIST]

[B]1.1.0 — Folia support[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Region-aware scheduling ([ICODE]folia-supported: true[/ICODE])
[*]Async teleport on Paper / Folia
[/LIST]

[B]1.0.0 — Initial release[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Homes, warps, TPA, back, RTP, god, fly, nofall, nohunger, menu, [ICODE]/aura[/ICODE]
[*]Shared teleport countdown · Minecraft 1.21.x and 26.1 / 26.2 · Java 21+
[/LIST]

